WEBVTT

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.330
Huh?

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.540
It's a dog!

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:09.880
Is it lost?

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.710
Good doggie, good doggie, good doggie!

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.170
Oh, it's so well-behaved!

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.420
Didn't someone tell us she had a dog earlier?

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:22.830
I see... A well-behaved male dog
that's kept in the house...

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.290
And that part of her that's an extreme S!

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.290
Did this conversation go wrong somewhere?

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.540
I wonder if he's hungry...

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.420
I have a cream-filled bread.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.750
If we're considerate of his health
and just give him a bit...

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.250
That was an amazing response time!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.210
Maybe he was considerably hungry.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.920
He probably was.

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:52.130
Too long...

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:55.130
Oh my... There's a ball over here.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:56.330
Go ahead and throw it.

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:57.500
There!

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:00.290
Good dog.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.420
There!

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.460
Why did it change into that?!

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:08.000
What in the world is going on in this park?

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:11.710
It looks like he can also do some special tricks...
Let's give it a try.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:12.750
Here goes.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.540
"Beg!"

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.790
Right off the bat?!

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:18.710
Huh?

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.170
Whoa! Hey hey hey!

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.630
Oh, no no no!

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:28.250
"Beg" is a bit more like... Huh?

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:33.250
What is that attitude?!

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:36.580
Honestly. What kind of owner do you have?

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:37.920
I've found him!

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:41.710
Butter! I was looking for you!

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:43.880
So it's you...

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.960
Th-then it's your dog, Rina-san...

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.330
Of course.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:50.880
Yes, he's a precious family member.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.580
Um... I think he misunderstands the command for "beg."

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:56.130
My, is that so?

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:00.880
Huh? Is that how that trick is done?

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:03.210
Which is really the right one?

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.960
Did I not just tell you?

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.460
A two day, one night school camping trip, huh?

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.170
Sounds fun, right?

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:46.540
Yes. However, it seems that every year
there are many students that get too wild.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.710
Presumably, to the sound of getting
taken advantage of by multiple-

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.040
Nooon non non non.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:54.630
Miss Omori said that due to that,
she'll get the class together and warn them in advance.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:56.670
If you cause problems I'm gonna punch you!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.460
Well, can't ignore that...

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:03.170
Also, Miss Koshimizu said to gather
all of the room numbers for the boys.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.460
And that will be thoroughly ignored.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:13.250
Since I heard about many people saying they feel uneasy
due to not being used to outdoor activities,

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.420
I attempted to gather
all of the necessary knowledge.

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:18.000
"Understanding Outdoor Activities..."

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.830
One: When going to the park late at night,

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.540
take measures against striped mosquitoes.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:25.000
Two: It is easier if hands are braced against a tree.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.420
Three: Positions...

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:30.170
Sorry, but didn't you say this was for outdoor activities?

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:31.960
Did I make a mistake?

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.330
Then this would be the right one.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.710
"Understanding Outdoor Activities..."

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.540
One: Selection of a collar is paramount.

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.080
Two: If any language but that of a dog is spoken,
there is a punishment.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:42.420
Bow-wow!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.630
Three: Crawling on all fours.
Bow-wow!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:44.250
Sniff!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.710
That's wrong.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:47.710
And that's why...

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:49.380
the meeting did not progress...

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.170
Every last one of them!

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:54.920
C-class 5 is already settled.

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.580
Well, that's because I'm exceptional!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.460
Everyone else in the class is exceptional...

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.670
Igarashi-chan, you have nothing to do with that.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.380
H-how rude!

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:08.380
I'll show you a replay of
a magnificent leader in my class!

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:11.880
We can confirm the details of today with this!

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.880
We don't have a grasp of it at all!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:14.670
Simple.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:18.960
By the way, Class 5 has decided on
a nighttime test of courage for their event!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.670
Th-that's right!

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:24.460
The thrill of the night is great, huh?

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.670
Shizu-chan?

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:31.420
Furthermore, if we're going to do it in a genuine way,
we have permission to use the equipment!

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:36.170
S..Sao-chan, do you like using 'equipment'?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.290
Shizu-chan?

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.670
The mountain route is a little complicated,

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.210
we must make arrangements

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:42.670
so no one will be separated from the group!

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:46.330
Then, how about if everyone held hands?

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.830
N-no way!

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:48.830
Why not?

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:53.460
B-because... It's embarrassing, isn't it?

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:54.960
Come now...

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.880
You were practicing on socks
how to use your tongue, weren't you?

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.710
Isn't THAT embarrassing?

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.920
That's SAX! Don't mess up the important part!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.880
Honestly, those guys are such a handful!

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.790
I want them to follow
the example of Class 5's brilliance!

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:14.500
Everyone! I'm going to do the
school camping trip overall summary now.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.250
We already did that in groups!

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:18.130
If there's anything bothering you or...

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:19.250
There's nothing in particular.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:20.500
The bus...

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.130
Everyone! Let's decide on
the seating order for the bus!

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.630
Igarashi-san.

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:36.000
Sorry, please tell us more
about the school camping trip!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.960
E-especially about... that nighttime event...

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.330
Here... This is my advance payment.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.000
Jee...

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.580
Jeez! Without me you'd all be lost!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:49.040
She seems sort of happy...

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.040
Great weather!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.420
The air is really wonderful
when you go this far, huh?

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:02.380
Yes.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:05.920
We're going to head to the campsite
on the mountain now, right?

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.790
That's where everyone will make lunch.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:12.250
Everyone! If you can't go any further,
you can 'come' to me!

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.960
You gotta add "If you're not feeling well"!

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.330
Anyway, I haven't been on a school camping trip with you
since high school, Itchan!

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.920
That's right... What an unfortunate relationship.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.040
That night, you were confessed to by a boy, right?

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.540
Did that happen, too?

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:31.630
Why did you reject him?
He was a fairly good-looking guy!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.920
I didn't really know him.

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:37.580
Slurp. What a waste...

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.670
And he was so well-hung!

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:42.500
How the hell do you know that?

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:48.750
Are you alright? Wanna take a breather?

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:54.080
If you're not used to it,
it gets harder to move your legs.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:57.170
It's true... This is the first time I'm experiencing it.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:01.460
This is how... everyone always feels, huh?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.250
Okay, that half-smile seems like a bit too much...

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:07.790
I'm itchy...

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.500
Did you get bitten by a mosquito?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.830
As long as it's just itchy, they can suck
as much blood as they want, really...

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:14.750
My mother also said that.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.880
"As long as it doesn't hurt, suck all you want."

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:20.250
It probably wasn't a mosquito she was talking about.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.290
I'll suck it...

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.210
Ow!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.500
Were you cut?

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.210
Show me which one.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:33.750
This is too bad... We have to disinfect it soon.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:40.000
Ah wi' doowitt...

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:40.880
Huh?!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.920
Shinozakhihaan...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.670
Shake, shake, shake...

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:53.920
Seiya-sama getting hit directly in the eyes
by all the spices due to the wind is wonderful!

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.940
The marvelous blend of the spices and tears...

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:59.220
spices and tears...

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.130
Thanks.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:04.540
Huh?

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.420
The animals of the mountain are here?!

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.500
I wonder if they felt invited by the aroma!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:11.880
Are you hungry?

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:15.130
If you don't mind, have some carrots and potatoes...

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:22.130
Hey now! You can't have that matsutake mushroom!

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:24.380
Hoshikawa-kun brought matsutake!

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:25.670
You must not go!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.460
Yes! It tastes good!

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:33.040
Saijo-san... Why did you make so much?

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:36.790
With this, all the gentlemen
will be throbbing and active!

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.790
What are you planning to do
when they're "active"?!

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:41.920
Everyone, it's ready!

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.080
Wait!

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.790
Just how many guys are you interested in?!

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.250
THAT'S...!

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:50.380
Eat a lot and gain some energy, okay?

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.500
Touched...

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:56.210
Maybe... My mind was in the gutter, there.

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:07.250
Yay! I caught you!

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:10.000
A..Ariyama-san?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.460
Huh?! What?!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.130
That's right! He's at the school camping trip!

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:17.130
I-I'm so sorry!

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:26.210
She smelled good.

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:48.380
What?

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:52.750
Not even one day has passed yet,
but you wanted to hear Kana's voice?

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.630
Yeah, yeah, that's it, that's totally it...

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.170
Jeez, Big Bro, you're such a lonely boy!

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:02.540
But also, sorry, but it seems like
I can't find the souvenir you asked for.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.380
No good. I won't accept anything but that.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:07.710
What? No matter what?

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.290
No matter what!

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:16.290
Maybe it's only because we're always together...

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.630
But it's lonely when Akiho isn't here.

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:23.080
Dad.

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:26.330
Dad... Goodbye.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:39.580
I am satisfied with your size, Natsuo-san.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.630
That isn't what I'm worried about.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.290
I was thinking that Akiho is going to go off
and be a wife one day...

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:49.170
I-is that what it was? It's okay.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:52.580
I will always be by your side.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.460
P-please, say something.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:11:59.670
Sorry...

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:01.960
I didn't think a normal response
would come from that.

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:08.040
Jeez... I can't get my mind off of it...

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:13.920
In the end, it was decided that the night event
would be a test of courage for the whole class.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:17.080
You'll be around the outside of the route, right?

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:18.040
Yes.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:20.380
So I'm scaring people...

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.880
Due to the suspension bridge effect,

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:26.420
a feeling of love has been known to develop
from the feeling of terror.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:29.790
With this chance...

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:32.920
it would be nice to deepen this relationship
with one another!

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:36.960
Hoshikawa-kun! Are you encouraging us?

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.080
Hoshikawa-san!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:39.750
What will you do under the cover of darkness?!

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.170
Okay then, let's go-

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:49.670
Is it okay if I do this...
until the test of courage is complete?

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:53.040
T-totally okay!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.290
I'm glad.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.210
So Kosaka-san hates dark places...

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:00.040
That's an unexpected side of her!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:08.210
R-right! As a boyfriend,
I'll protect her with all I've got!

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:09.670
As a girlfriend...

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:12.420
I have to protect Shinozaki-san's chastity!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.040
Hoshikawa-san, where are you lurking?

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.580
And she hates being frightened too...

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:23.710
You don't have to be scared,
I don't think they'll do anything that dangerous, y'know?

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:26.080
Y-you must stay on your guard!

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.460
There is still the possibility of coming across
something dangerous!

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:34.040
But... Y-you're with me, so, I mean... You're safe!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:37.750
No! Since you are with me, I'm a bit less safe...

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.170
Huh? Am I... unreliable?

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:43.830
What's this pressure?!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.080
Shizumori-san...

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.040
I'll introduce you.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.040
This is Class 4's
student council representative.

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.170
Y-you found me...

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:55.000
You followed us to try to scare us, right?

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:56.630
Hello...

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:00.040
S-sorry... I ruined the excitement.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.580
It's okay, I don't mind that at all.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:06.580
R-really?! Then...

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:11.920
Then is there still a chance that there will be
some excitement between... you two?

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:16.080
You tailed us in order to scare us... Right?

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.500
Now that their guard is down,
this is our chance!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.670
Ready? We're gonna give 'em a proper scare!

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:21.960
Aye, aye,Sir!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.920
'Kay, here I go!

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.290
Oh, sorry!

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.420
Nice shot!

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:32.960
Oh, if you try to force it, it won't come out.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.540
Okay, we can sell this.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:37.290
Don't take that picture!

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:46.000
That voice is Rina-san's!

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.880
No, don't!

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:50.710
Don't come near me!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.670
Rina-san! Are you okay?!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.330
What in the world?!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.380
What happened here?

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.130
All of a sudden... mutual fondling...

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:08.880
And you were understandably panicked.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:09.710
"Mutual... fondling"?

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:10.750
Amazing!
"Mutual... fondling"?

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:12.330
Dear sister!

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:17.750
Dammit. Being on patrol is such a pain...

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.630
It's a lot of effort, isn't it...

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.170
So you were over there?

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:25.040
Let's finish this up and go back.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:27.920
That's right...

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:31.630
Three more left for our quota,
so just a little mo-

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.250
I'm not playing with you.

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:34.210
Mwah!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:37.790
I wonder what's going to come out next.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:39.630
It can't be that... Huh?

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:42.500
Something weird came out!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.540
It's finally come out!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.290
What the hell is that?

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.960
Oh, yeah! Yes! Come on!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.960
I'm scared, Akiho-chan!

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:52.040
Rina-san!

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.710
Uh-huh... You two, calm down a bit-

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:58.460
I'm sorry. I've calmed down a bit somehow.

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:00.250
What's going on?!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:03.830
Whoa! It's coming this way again!

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:05.000
I won't let it!

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:20.460
I... I can scare them by myself...
e-even without relying on those guys!

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:22.250
A target?!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.750
O-okay! Here I go...

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:33.920
Nooo!

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:41.170
I'm seeing you cry in the middle of the woods!

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:44.290
Tell me more details about this!

